{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46883","headline":"荆州新秋寺居写怀诗五首上南平王 五 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋寺居写怀诗五首上南平王 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石龛闲锁旧居峰，何事膺门岁月重。\n五七诗中叨见遇，三千客外许疎慵。\n迎凉蟋蟀喧闲思，积雨莓苔没屐踪。\n会待英雄啓金口，却教担锡入云松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}